  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2026-05-11T17:18:37-04:00\" title=\"Monday, May 11, 2026, 5:18 pm\">May 11, 2026</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The gallery is now open weekends, 11am to 4 pm weekends. Starting Memorial Day and running through Labor Day the gallery will be open daily, 11am to 4pm; with extended hours during Wednesday evening Harwich Port Stroll. We invite you to stop by our refurbished gallery view paintings by twenty-two member artists.  A gallery artist will welcome you and answer your questions.  Free parking is available across the street.<img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7420\" src=\"/media/archive/16ac9cb57194254ad108e10e78a272bc1c9f6bec07d0ed17fac5b171f4a65512.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7222\" src=\"/media/archive/f9c6f4a21e088077161ad9214ac2ad9537996429d79b21f6c6c420e5526d8e59.jpg\" alt=\"Art gallery entrance with flowers and sign.\" width=\"178\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7419\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6a38548a0ecf52e427a9e75b9e9375a6f213695227c54f3191a2c701e41f84.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
